[{"title":"寿钱霞蔚","author":"释今无","text":"独抱冰霜骨，梅花万树开。\n金丹人取去，玉蕊手持来。\n问法寻刍叟，吟诗向古台。\n胜因从此结，予愧有尘埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁孝廉画石教授寿康","author":"释今无","text":"上书裘尚黑，作宦帐先红。\n道德传前辈，文章教巨工。\n山寒官路阔，心静玉堂空。\n老我相期意，依依在此中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴司李锦雯偕令弟我蕃并陆丽京张宗绪顾祥士过访 其一","author":"释今无","text":"霜菊荒三径，冰壶共一船。\n綵云看满地，奇蕊落诸天。\n道见祥刑合，名先大雅传。\n山僧禅悦里，得结此中缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴司李锦雯偕令弟我蕃并陆丽京张宗绪顾祥士过访 其二","author":"释今无","text":"世路劳车马，清言重缙绅。\n居心原有地，君虑自无尘。\n古佛仪犹在，苍生望又新。\n群公兼此意，慧远亦亲人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47018,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜潘明府澹庵至","author":"释今无","text":"兰堂来上客，琼海意中人。\n觅我琴留舫，看君气似春。\n风尘消宦兴，诗酒固天真。\n莫着羊裘去，烟波泛钓津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47019,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿何鸣玉","author":"释今无","text":"鳌首三山稳，松枝万叶稠。\n閒心原似水，高节竟凌秋。\n国计才尤敏，朋情意独优。\n碧峰飞白鹤，欢喜进双筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47020,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈融谷从雄州至五羊相见且言归浙送行二章 其一","author":"释今无","text":"恳恻欣相见，慇勤复送归。\n月寒南粤地，风入富春衣。\n千嶂窥人寂，双瞳似尔稀。\n无穷兰蕙草，何处借芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47021,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈融谷从雄州至五羊相见且言归浙送行二章 其二","author":"释今无","text":"作赋文心好，言诗雅道高。\n既能惊世眼，尤见恋僧袍。\n雁语占星斗，鼍行郁海涛。\n倘能修短札，寄我莫辞劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47022,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈石人归闽","author":"释今无","text":"归路潮阳直，逢僧海寺初。\n高名空可恋，寒树独教疏。\n涷月光先动，狂帆意自如。\n纵然无雁到，亦记寄双鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47023,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿张梦回 其一","author":"释今无","text":"小范胸中似，维摩屋里真。\n雄心能度日，石磬不生尘。\n抖出松枝雪，携来柏叶春。\n廿年同学道，君作采芝人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿张梦回 其二","author":"释今无","text":"白鹤语高墀，红霞映赤蜺。\n山藏安石日，人在霸陵时。\n月满篁溪竹，花开古佛池。\n原称无量寿，于此更何疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿彭明府退庵 其一","author":"释今无","text":"大智应持世，明珠合走盘。\n古棠春气密，厚泽邑人欢。\n笔墨南宫壮，云霞北斗寒。\n此心无间断，常作万年看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿彭明府退庵 其二","author":"释今无","text":"律清欣黍谷，星老爱长庚。\n海屋原归鹤，春风自入城。\n活人宁有数，护法感常情。\n天静琅琅雁，云端有好声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭明府退庵招同江若海诸公茶集","author":"释今无","text":"所思隔珠江，一苇法流通。\n高盖低银浪，清谈夺綵虹。\n水浮荷气密，风落竹声同。\n斟酌双兰影，芳馨还令公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其一","author":"释今无","text":"夜行将落月，寒看欲曙天。\n事抛离岸后，心系放舟前。\n暝色攻衫薄，繁霜滴缆圆。\n此中辛苦意，专为送流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其二","author":"释今无","text":"于我原无事，因人倍复忙。\n雁归燕地雪，客犯岭头霜。\n山木何曾脱，江云只是长。\n所嗟非气候，别有旅魂伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其三","author":"释今无","text":"偶然为此役，行止笑难期。\n入夜依沙际，长吟山峡时。\n嶂深猿穴壮，名在水云疑。\n我亦从兹悟，寒江酌一卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其四","author":"释今无","text":"已见三秋雁，犹行十月风。\n往来无至计，得丧欲将穷。\n沙迥寒鸥白，山高夜火红。\n空将寥廓意，独宿暮烟中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其五","author":"释今无","text":"世岂藏名地，山当骤鹿宜。\n偏舟生范蠡，片石死要离。\n寂寞惟看月，经营不及时。\n此时松柏色，难得是高枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其六","author":"释今无","text":"别俗敦高尚，和光贵大乘。\n自来同嚼蜡，今更欲餐冰。\n白发徒兼鬓，黄金不作绳。\n孤舟迎浪上，此处若为平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其七","author":"释今无","text":"蒙叟梦先得，彭篯术未工。\n露兼凉月下，影逐大江空。\n雨过啼閒鸟，天低落近虹。\n玉鞭吾欲把，帝座莫为通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其八","author":"释今无","text":"无事孤骞兴，秋江一棹寻。\n不因今日役，亦有此时心。\n星起猿啼泽，人醒月在林。\n更寻何处宿，前路一灯深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其九","author":"释今无","text":"才别还相逐，同行落后波。\n世难知己少，路远受风多。\n谷口云初断，樯阴雁已过。\n相看虚岁月，不及一渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶石舟中 其十","author":"释今无","text":"今岁菊花候，舟行未暂停。\n枫林秋岸赤，石色峡中青。\n身倦重朝梦，鸥寒集晚汀。\n微愁无计遣，力不到参苓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大士石","author":"释今无","text":"圆明一念固，不比望夫山。\n云绕乾坤阔，灯悬日月閒。\n三边随业见，一夜逐人还。\n不尽杨枝水，长流入世间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"射鼋鱼者","author":"释今无","text":"挟矢候江阴，鼋鱼出绿浔。\n年华生意苦，天地杀机深。\n掬水犹磨雪，侵肌竟是金。\n高山不可住，令我独沉吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鸬鹚 其一","author":"释今无","text":"辛勤始得食，汝亦为谁忙。\n水性微生苦，潭深薄暮寒。\n宾鸿飞自远，翡翠立应欢。\n人欲几曾厌，毛衣何日乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鸬鹚 其二","author":"释今无","text":"欲大方怜汝，身微亦系人。\n常随孤桨去，不与众毛亲。\n潮落愁空坦，鱼寒隐夜津。\n宁啼杜鹃血，飞过万山春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鸬鹚 其三","author":"释今无","text":"金弹落饥鸟，寒潮变绿芜。\n身随閒处贱，力向苦中无。\n入水全凭眼，提筐不用呼。\n月明归未得，刷羽向江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅舟遇人之京","author":"释今无","text":"分符南海客，走马蓟门天。\n穗石别多日，韶阳同泊船。\n旧名遗爱在，新月大荒圆。\n更得朝衣著，何年再问禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其一","author":"释今无","text":"壮岁逢沙汰，髫年饱乱离。\n计穷观世日，悲正及秋时。\n短发羞人见，长贫有钵知。\n我心不可转，鸥鸟莫相疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其二","author":"释今无","text":"运会丁黄檗，分徒类夹山。\n愁多伤肺易，僧老改形难。\n夜入疏钟苦，潮归独院寒。\n无聊频徙倚，犹把梵书看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其三","author":"释今无","text":"安能关至计，无乃损皇仁。\n错念观前世，闲言误后人。\n昙花甘委雪，篱槿岂禁春。\n谁道琉璃国，笳吹不起尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其四","author":"释今无","text":"檀林烧豆火，水族失龙鳞。\n乘槎难及汉，避俗敢言秦。\n碧海徒多梦，青山已少人。\n独怜边徼地，不及帝城春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其五","author":"释今无","text":"天地微生薄，风霜岁月赊。\n金钩奔醉象，玉盏落长蛇。\n草遇千年雪，莺啼二月花。\n宝龛尘渐积，珍重拂轻纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其六","author":"释今无","text":"袈裟犹未白，螺髻镇常青。\n有愿酬今日，无言问小乘。\n情田心莫莫，玉海泪盈盈。\n满山松柏色，不作旧时声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其七","author":"释今无","text":"圣朝应勿阙，斯道与斯文。\n清磬凭谁击，名香岂易焚。\n寒星人外见，天梵静中闻。\n纵得常如此，沙鸥已失群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其八","author":"释今无","text":"万物欣其盛，何能守寂寥。\n月沉空有恨，风急自无潮。\n一念终难到，三禅岂易烧。\n还将金玉带，依旧镇山腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其九","author":"释今无","text":"庄严欣帝梵，衰落妒波旬。\n究竟空怜我，依然不怨人。\n灵蛇收鲤眼，宝剑涸龙津。\n却怪林逋鹤，生来骨相贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相江叹 其十","author":"释今无","text":"海竭珊瑚死，林深虎豹屯。\n无人添食钵，教我住荒村。\n梦逐梅花去，形愁槁木存。\n长廊风寂寂，日落自关门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往来胥口不得登岸柬王明府默庵 其一","author":"释今无","text":"心知谈笑处，两逐往来程。\n此邑山形壮，故人江水清。\n署寒琴指冷，天静雁声明。\n宰政原辛苦，君兼百代情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往来胥口不得登岸柬王明府默庵 其二","author":"释今无","text":"城荒秋草遍，天远彩云多。\n独树连高峡，斜阳撼夕波。\n弓裘传旧业，雨露得新和。\n柔橹乘潮去，长吟一望过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿樊犬愿","author":"释今无","text":"五十一年前，香花结寿筵。\n文心坚大道，微愿薄诸天。\n里俗推先辈，丛林即后贤。\n如今无枣柏，坚固是金仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴伯子归琼海","author":"释今无","text":"未必终如此，功名自有时。\n海云千里阔，林月五更悲。\n爱子能相见，愁予是别离。\n古人裘破后，此段竟谁知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈白禄之京","author":"释今无","text":"陶朱不可学，张禄岂堪名。\n正值重阳日，言从万里行。\n燕台寒雪蚤，庾岭小梅清。\n相忆归来候，明年春雁声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屈五明秋捷","author":"释今无","text":"亲老先能慰，文章始是真。\n持心期旧日，梦笔爱新人。\n水到天河润，花从北地春。\n征衫须自脱，何处有京尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈表学秋捷","author":"释今无","text":"喜看惊座客，战胜向秋天。\n芳誉从人著，樨香入耳圆。\n路迎金阙日，裘阔玉河烟。\n绣佛龛前望，如君本少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿朱说梅明府","author":"释今无","text":"知君心自达，杯酒可为欢。\n閒处寻归马，尘中不恨官。\n月临沧海阔，花照客庭寒。\n上寿琴音见，椿枝欲赠难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陆仲侯","author":"释今无","text":"白眼原难富，丹青岂贷贫。\n甑中飞野马，世上待何人。\n地僻长无雪，花妍不是春。\n少年沽美酒，更莫望乡津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蒋徂来明府八骏图 其一","author":"释今无","text":"地厚凝云暗，天高积雪长。\n一声过大宛，万里到扶桑。\n空旷随青草，驱驰限紫缰。\n旅魂劳易倦，托尔在斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蒋徂来明府八骏图 其二","author":"释今无","text":"不怨孙阳去，方怜逸足来。\n人名高凤阁，雪路困龙媒。\n绿水嘶时涷，红云踏处开。\n深思长独立，未必胜无才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪汉翀水部","author":"释今无","text":"交久心逾好，深持长者风。\n诗名高往哲，道力破洪濛。\n补脑天浆白，留颜大药红。\n君犹情未惬，宦迹厌飘蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送罗学制守阃","author":"释今无","text":"三年能读礼，此日复谈军。\n甲胄威犹在，蹄轮路自分。\n剑光连蚌气，笔阵战山云。\n勋业从兹大，高鶱列雁群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为刘子两大命名示此","author":"释今无","text":"大道原无二，期君两大之。\n玉堂云起日，宝地月明时。\n随步堪闻桂，趋庭可学诗。\n圣贤皆努力，才气正相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祝词","author":"释今无","text":"北岭松犹盛，南山鹤可闻。\n堂悬三岛月，杯泛五湖云。\n綵凤飞无已，天花落自纷。\n与君同浩劫，握手问高旻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张全之将归桐城同姚梅长行过宿海幢诗以送之","author":"释今无","text":"归路同良友，兼逢野寺僧。\n松枝高壮气，海色送孤城。\n潮起船头合，江虚棹影清。\n莫言不相寄，到处有鸿声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送任玉书之秦中","author":"释今无","text":"北去走风尘，襟期万里新。\n月临官渡阔，花向大江春。\n得意惟驱马，挥金好赠人。\n珠江江上月，相忆最相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张穆之买泷水山移家索赠","author":"释今无","text":"别寻幽壑胜，壮气此中消。\n逸足已云远，閒云祇自招。\n易观沧海日，难问古今潮。\n暂去还来此，朋侪叹寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘汉臣归凤城","author":"释今无","text":"草室无馀蕴，君归幸念之。\n暮云兰叶架，疏雨藕花池。\n义寂文心薄，珠明智眼移。\n毋为逐卑论，白社订幽期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其一","author":"释今无","text":"贳地开精舍，穿渠待竹林。\n了无香火念，只有水云心。\n锄起惊秋草，虫分隔路吟。\n莫言吾自限，用意此中深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其二","author":"释今无","text":"略似苏公意，无湖祇有堤。\n水来拖素练，日落卧长霓。\n辨土寻龙脉，扶筇听鸟啼。\n对人挥汗罢，潇洒在鸡栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其三","author":"释今无","text":"大块真劳我，高天亦限人。\n溪山千片石，城郭一朝春。\n锄过坭痕滑，堆平月色匀。\n古人还负担，吾敢厌嚣尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其四","author":"释今无","text":"冬至移花候，春当插柳时。\n斫柴徐计颗，得米已堪炊。\n海色归新圃，风声聚乱枝。\n少年贫贱早，生计苦相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其五","author":"释今无","text":"耕凿真无力，逢迎已入心。\n眼徒空处白，地是几时阴。\n梅即能飘雪，霞先漫落金。\n殷勤多自爱，肯受二毛侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其六","author":"释今无","text":"锹子乾坤阔，阿师气宇低。\n无田开大义，有路作卑蹊。\n白拂穿林易，黄花照眼迷。\n旧时飞动意，寂寞向畬坭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其七","author":"释今无","text":"已分僧俗路，难爱浅深田。\n石破通山气，风吹入海烟。\n乞人移树色，借贷散工钱。\n抱膝吾还乐，艰难过六年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其八","author":"释今无","text":"蛟龙潜地骨，钟磬任天心。\n粥饭有缘聚，云山随处深。\n海波吹自昔，人迹在如今。\n亦是难由我，馀生听陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤诗 其九","author":"释今无","text":"平生期浪迹，岂意作开山。\n百短同衰鬓，千般只笑颜。\n棘林藏月碎，弓地聚云閒。\n抖擞辽东衲，何时着过关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海幢基趾即予少年卖饼地也","author":"释今无","text":"饼卖当年地，禅栖此日心。\n长林飞翡翠，短褐接华簪。\n螮蝀惊弦落，龙蛇喷雾深。\n不须神拔树，吾种亦成阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊申夏日喜张百庵中秘过访却赠即送还朝 其一","author":"释今无","text":"八桂皇华使，仙帆泛五羊。\n星光还远近，逸气正苍茫。\n琢句江山古，寻幽花雨香。\n元来屋里客，麈尾好商量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":47084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]